OL,3,A'Serious incident' at tiger enclosure
OL,4,Acloses park
OL,5,
OL,6,FEmergency services are responding to a
OL,7,F"serious incident" at the tiger
OL,8,Fenclosure at Yorkshire Wildlife Park.
OL,10,FIn a statement posted on its website,
OL,11,Fthe visitor attraction said its
OL,12,Femergency response procedures had been
OL,13,F"immediately activated" and it was
OL,14,F"working closely with the authorities
OL,15,Fto ascertain exactly what happened".
OL,17,FThe park, near Doncaster, will remain
OL,18,Fclosed for the remainder of the
OL,19,Fweekend, it added.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
